                    </span>
                </div>
                <div class="preset-item" onclick="loadPreset(['C', 'H', 'H', 'H', 'H'])">
                    <span>Метан (CH₄)</span>
                    <span style="display:flex; gap:2px; align-items:center;">
                        <span class="atom-ball atom-C" style="width:18px;height:18px;font-size:0.55rem;">C</span>
                        <span class="atom-ball atom-H" style="width:14px;height:14px;font-size:0.4rem;">H</span>
                        <span class="atom-ball atom-H" style="width:14px;height:14px;font-size:0.4rem;">H</span>
                        <span class="atom-ball atom-H" style="width:14px;height:14px;font-size:0.4rem;">H</span>
                        <span class="atom-ball atom-H" style="width:14px;height:14px;font-size:0.4rem;">H</span>
                    </span>
                </div>
                <div class="preset-item" onclick="loadPreset(['C', 'O'])">
                    <span>Угарний газ (CO)</span>
                    <span style="display:flex; gap:4px; align-items:center;">
                        <span class="atom-ball atom-C" style="width:18px;height:18px;font-size:0.55rem;">C</span>
                        <span class="atom-ball atom-O" style="width:18px;height:18px;font-size:0.55rem;">O</span>
